    "detailed_description": "<h1>A CINEMATIC SPACE SHOOTER - WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>History</strong><br>The main character named Theo was born on the planet &quot;T&quot;. The whole world of the planet has dangerous caves into which it is forbidden to descend. Together with the main character, you have to explore the underworld avoiding dangers.<br><br>ProjectTeo - Teo is a brave resident of the Underworld &quot;T&quot;<br><br>Game features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collecting keys<br></li><li>Dangerous saws<br></li><li>Convenient management<br></li><li>The ability to replenish health<br></li><li>Difficult levels<br></li><li>Achievements obtained by passing levels.</li></ul><br>The main character &quot;Theo&quot; has 4 powerful wings that allow you to smoothly descend and maneuver between deadly saws and dangerous inhabitants of the underworld.<br><br>To complete the level, you need to collect keys on the entire level. The number of keys required to move to a new level is indicated near the teleport.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>History</strong><br>The main character named Theo was born on the planet &quot;T&quot;. The whole world of the planet has dangerous caves into which it is forbidden to descend. Together with the main character, you have to explore the underworld avoiding dangers.<br><br>ProjectTeo - Teo is a brave resident of the Underworld &quot;T&quot;<br><br>Game features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collecting keys<br></li><li>Dangerous saws<br></li><li>Convenient management<br></li><li>The ability to replenish health<br></li><li>Difficult levels<br></li><li>Achievements obtained by passing levels.</li></ul><br>The main character &quot;Theo&quot; has 4 powerful wings that allow you to smoothly descend and maneuver between deadly saws and dangerous inhabitants of the underworld.<br><br>To complete the level, you need to collect keys on the entire level. The number of keys required to move to a new level is indicated near the teleport.",
